# Snaps for EVERY Linux machine with a running snapd — headless servers and
# 64-bit Pis included, not just desktops. Installed by
# run_after_18-linux-snaps.sh (stamp-and-compare). Containers are skipped
# automatically: no systemd as PID 1 means no snapd.
#
# Only CLI/server tools that need no display belong here; GUI apps go in
# packages.snap. As with that file, prefer Homebrew for anything it ships and
# use snap only where the Snap Store is the best channel (e.g. lxd, microk8s,
# certbot).
#
# Names only, one per line — the installer extracts via `grep -Ev '^#|^$'`.
